### 3.2 `rlm_execute`

Sandboxed Recursive Language Model (RLM) REPL executor with transactional Copy-on-Write (CoW) rollback, 3-phase EGRI safety linters, and self-tuning compute governor.

#### JSON Schema
```json
{
  "name": "rlm_execute",
  "description": "Sandboxed RLM REPL executor with transactional CoW rollback, 3-phase EGRI linter, governor.",
  "inputSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "query": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Natural language inspection or auditing task prompt."
      },
      "code": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Python control code to execute in the Transactional CoW sandbox."
      },
      "scope_paths": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": { "type": "string" },
        "description": "List of relative workspace file paths to stream into context."
      }
    }
  }
}
```

#### Example Invocation: Direct CoW REPL Execution
```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 11,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "rlm_execute",
    "arguments": {
      "code": "lines = [l for l in context.splitlines() if 'API_KEY' in l]\nprint(f'Matches: {len(lines)}')\nresult = len(lines)"
    }
  }
}
```

#### Example Result (Success):
```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 11,
  "result": {
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "{\n  \"status\": \"STEP_SUCCESS\",\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"output\": \"Matches: 2\",\n  \"variables\": [\n    \"lines\",\n    \"result\"\n  ],\n  \"active_beliefs\": \"No verified facts recorded.\",\n  \"stdout\": \"Matches: 2\",\n  \"errors\": []\n}"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

#### Example Result (Safety AST Linter Rejection):
```json
