## 4. Backward-Compatible Legacy Aliases

For seamless integration with earlier Christina, Graphify, and RLM plugin versions, the FastMCP server maps legacy tool names to the 4 canonical tools automatically:

| Legacy Tool Name | Canonical Tool Target | Automatic Parameter Transformation |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `graphify_query` | `cpg_query` | Direct passthrough (`symbol`, `mode`, `depth`) |
| `graphify_build` | `cpg_query` | Dispatches `cpg_query(mode="info")` |
| `graphify_blast_radius` | `cpg_query` | Forces `mode="blast_radius"` |
| `rlm_query` | `rlm_execute` | Maps `query` and `scope_paths` |
| `rlm_repl_exec` | `rlm_execute` | Maps `code` to CoW REPL execution |
| `rlm_execute_query` | `rlm_execute` | Direct passthrough |
| `memory_search` | `memory_evolve` | Forces `action="search"` |
| `memory_persist` | `memory_evolve` | Forces `action="persist"` |
| `memory_learn` / `learn`| `memory_evolve` | Forces `action="persist"` |
| `okf_memory_search` | `memory_evolve` | Forces `action="search"` |
| `epistemic_gc` | `memory_evolve` | Forces `action="gc"` |
| `distill_global` | `memory_evolve` | Forces `action="distill_global"` |
| `query_global` | `memory_evolve` | Forces `action="query_global"` |
| `blackboard_query` | `swarm_blackboard` | Forces `action="rd"` |
| `blackboard_out` | `swarm_blackboard` | Forces `action="out"` |
| `swarm_occ_commit` | `swarm_blackboard` | Forces `action="occ_validate"` |

